BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hope & Main Makers Markets: Summer Series
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260701
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260702
DTSTAMP:20260813T112541Z
UID:a4c76656bb4dd2f560a21d25ca37@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Developed by the operators of Hope &amp\; Main in Warren\, the
  Schoolyard Market helps locally-based food and beverage businesses start 
 up\, scale and thrive. This year's markets features over 20 local vendors 
 and is held outside a century-old converted school building with plenty of
  space for shopping produce and local food products\, with a bit of live m
 usic and fun programming for all ages throughout the market. Hope &amp\; M
 ain can't wait to introduce you to new members who will be selling their p
 roducts\, and of course\, we'll have some old favorites too. Fridays from 
 4:00 &#8211\; 7:00 PM\, all summer through August 28th. Opening Day is Fri
 day\, June 26th! All markets will happen rain or shine\, with free entry a
 nd parking!\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/hope-%26-mai
 n-makers-markets%3a-summer-series/109931/
LOCATION:Hope & Main\, 691 Main Street\, Warren\, RI 02885
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/hope-%26-main-makers-markets%3a
 -summer-series/109931/
END:VEVENT
