BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:"Mea Duke: Dreamliners" Exhibit
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260801
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260802
DTSTAMP:20260813T112541Z
UID:c06cfbf2bf6470118f0deef8d28e@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Jessica Hagen Fine Art + Design is pleased to announce the exh
 ibit: "Mea Duke: Dreamliners" August 1 - August 30\, 2026. This solo exhib
 ition marks Mea Duke’s third solo show with Jessica Hagen’s gallery. D
 reamliners assembles objects and images from the mid-twentieth century mom
 ent when progress felt most like destiny: Pan Am flying boats\, LIFE magaz
 ines\, lifejackets\, sunblock\, straw hats\, shipping containers\, endless
  horizons. Together they form an archive of optimism\, sleek engineering\,
  and the promise that the world was suddenly\, thrillingly within reach. T
 he title borrows from Boeing's Dreamliner\, an aircraft whose name still t
 rades on the same aspirational language the Pan Am era perfected. Duke's p
 ractice has long lived in the space between painting an object and treatin
 g the painting itself as an object\, an artifact with its own weight\, mat
 eriality\, and history. Jessica Hagen states\, “Dreamliners is a smart\,
  fun and beautifully executed show. Mea Duke is a highly skilled painter a
 nd she is very clearly on top of her game\; treating us to paintings that 
 are in her words\, created slowly by hand\, with clean deliberate precisio
 n. Replete with iconic objects and imagery rendered as only Duke can\, thi
 s show is not to be missed.” “Mea Duke: Dreamliners” closes August 3
 0\, 2026. Jessica Hagen Fine Art + Design was founded in 2005 and features
  contemporary art including painting\, sculpture\, photography\, ceramics\
 , textiles\, and jewelry. Located in the historic Point section of Newport
 \, the gallery’s hours are Wednesday- Saturday 11:00 AM - 5:00 PM\, and 
 Sunday 12:00 - 5:00 PM. The gallery is also open by appointment. Image Att
 ached: Mea Duke Flying Boat I oil/canvas 40” x 64”\n\nSource: https://
 www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/mea-duke%3a-dreamliners-exhibit/111171/
LOCATION:Jessica Hagen Fine Art & Design\, 9A Bridge Street\, Newport\, RI
  02840
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/mea-duke%3a-dreamliners-exhibit
 /111171/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Washington County Fair
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260812
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260813
DTSTAMP:20260813T112541Z
UID:e9349cbadfa54061b73d240ec35b@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The Fair is RI's largest agricultural event. Admission include
 s access to all daily concerts\, special acts and events\, the giant midwa
 y and kiddy land area (all ride tickets &amp\; games separate)\, agricultu
 ral events/shows\, exhibits/displays\, tractor and horse pulls\, farm muse
 um\, and much more! At the Main Stage pine grove you can relax and enjoy s
 ome of music's hottest acts...one of the biggest draws to the Fair is toda
 y's Country Music Stars! Bring the entire family for five full days of FUN
 !\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/washington-county-fair
 /110326/
LOCATION:Washington County Fairgrounds\, 78 Richmond Townhouse Road\, Rich
 mond\, RI 02812
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/washington-county-fair/110326/
END:VEVENT
