BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:1776| 2026: Inside the Exhibition
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260813
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260814
DTSTAMP:20260813T112541Z
UID:8e718bc11e7dcac4a94746841218@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:1776| 2026: Inside the Exhibition When: Thursday\, August 13th
  from 4:00 &#8211\; 5:00 PM Location: Rough Point Museum\, 680 Bellevue Av
 enue\, Newport Go behind-the-scenes of 1776 | 2026: The Newport Restoratio
 n Foundation Reflects on the American Revolution. Inspired by Doris Duke
 ’s remarkable legacy\, the Newport Restoration Foundation today preserve
 s objects\, sites\, and stories with connections to the American Revolutio
 n. This tour will share more about the stories behind the art\, craft\, an
 d design on display—including works of furniture\, architectural drawing
 s\, and fashion. Know before you go: This tour is wheelchair accessible.\n
 \nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/1776%7c-2026%3a-inside-th
 e-exhibition/109784/
LOCATION:Rough Point Museum\, 680 Bellevue Avenue\, Newport Go behind-the-
 scenes of 1776 | 2026: The Newport Restoration Foundation Reflects on the 
 American Revolution. Inspired by Doris Duke’s remarkable legacy\, the Ne
 wport Restoration Foundation today preserves objects\, sites\, and stories
  with connections to the American Revolution. This tour will share more ab
 out the stories behind the art\, craft\, and design on display—including
  works of furniture\, architectural drawings\, and fashion. Know before yo
 u go: This tour is wheelchair accessible. Show More View Website | Email 1
  / 1 Additional Information\, 680 Bellevue Avenue\, Newport\, RI 02840
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/1776%7c-2026%3a-inside-the-exhi
 bition/109784/
