BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Brew at the Zoo
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260813
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260814
DTSTAMP:20260813T112541Z
UID:c76b835bed7699adab002ceae464@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Tap into your wild side at Brew at the Zoo on Saturday\, Augus
 t 29th\, an adults-only evening event\, and sample hundreds of beers\, har
 d seltzers\, wines and ready-to-drink cocktails from dozens of local\, reg
 ional and national breweries. This year’s event is bigger and better tha
 n ever with the addition of a brand-new wine tasting experience! Enjoy liv
 e musical entertainment by TJ &amp\; the Campers\, animal encounters\, and
  more at Rhode Island’s largest outdoor beer festival. This is a 21+ eve
 nt\, and no person under the age of 21 will be permitted (including infant
 s). All attendees are required to show a valid ID. Rain or shine\, tickets
  are non-refundable.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/bre
 w-at-the-zoo/110973/
