BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Island Rhodes Music Festival
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260816
DTSTAMP:20260813T112541Z
UID:ace7c364f24262c067e163fb9b96@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The Ocean State is welcoming a brand-new marquee music festiva
 l this summer with the debut of Centreville Bank Stadium’s first-ever co
 ncert event\, Island Rhodes Music Festival. Set to take place the weekend 
 of August 15-16 at Centreville Bank Stadium in Pawtucket\, Rhode Island\, 
 the two-day festival will transform the state-of-the-art waterfront venue 
 into a vibrant celebration of live music\, culture\, and coastal energy. I
 sland Rhodes Music Festival will feature two full days of top-tier nationa
 l touring artists fans can’t see anywhere else in the region\, including
  Sublime\, Slightly Stoopid\, Rebelution\, The Roots\, and more\, all perf
 orming on a turntable stage throughout the weekend. Designed to reflect Rh
 ode Island’s creative spirit and coastal roots\, the festival will offer
  fans an immersive experience that goes beyond the music. Alongside perfor
 mances from top current artists and genre-defining legends\, Island Rhodes
  will feature a curated mix of standout food vendors — from regional fav
 orites to elevated festival fare — plus premium VIP experiences designed
  for fans who want to take the weekend up a level. TICKETS\n\nSource: http
 s://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/island-rhodes-music-festival/109333/
LOCATION:Centreville Bank Stadium\, 11 Tidewater Street\, Pawtucket\, RI 0
 2860
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/island-rhodes-music-festival/10
 9333/
END:VEVENT
